     Construct a high-quality 26-circle packing.
 
     The search starts from both square/interstice and staggered-layer
     geometries.  Every nonlinear result is evaluated by a radius LP.  The
     strongest candidate is then used as the base of several deterministic
     continuation restarts, which can change the local contact graph without
     paying for a broad random multistart search.
